+```
+Background Thread              Main Thread Event Loop
+      │                              │
+      │ sender.send(frame)           │ (sleeping)
+      │         │                    │
+      │         └──► flume channel ──┤
+      │                              │
+      │                    recv_async().await wakes
+      │                              │
+      │                    ForegroundExecutor re-polls task
+      │                              │
+      │                    dispatch_on_main_thread()
+      │                              │
+      │                    ping.ping() ◄── wakes calloop!
+      │                              │
+      │                    process_frame() + notify()
+      │                              │
+      │                    window.refresh()
+      │                              │
+      │                    UI updates! ✓
+```
